              "kind": "scalar",
              "tag": "!!str",
              "value": "meta",
              "head": "# PVE external blobstore overlay (RustFS / any S3-compatible endpoint).\n#\n# Activates when the +pve-external-blobstore feature is set. Reads from the\n# env-scoped vault config base (meta.ocfp.vault.config = secret/config/\u003cbloc\u003e/\n# \u003cmgmt|ocf\u003e), matching the ocfp CLI's vault populate scheme. Both mgmt-BOSH\n# and env-BOSH must still resolve to the SAME bucket, because bosh's\n# compilation flow requires the deployment's agent blobstore to contain the\n# parent director's stored release blobs; the populate step writes the same\n# bucket name/endpoint to both the mgmt and ocf blobstore secrets.\n#\n#   \u003cmeta.ocfp.vault.config\u003e/bosh/blobstores/bosh\n#     :name        shared bucket name (e.g. \u003cbloc\u003e-bosh)\n#     :endpoint    https://host:port (RustFS endpoint)\n#     :region      S3 region label\n#     :host        host portion of endpoint (for director's blobstore.host)\n#     :ca_cert     PEM, optional (internal-ca/self-signed modes)\n#\n#   \u003cmeta.ocfp.vault.config\u003e/bosh/blobstores/bosh/creds\n#     :access_key\n#     :secret_key\n",
              "line": 23
            },
